  at the end of a run (AFTER all relaxation, molecular dynamics, etc.).

  | Total energy of the DFT / Hartree-Fock s.c.f. calculation      :          -7144.053653950 eV
  | Final zero-broadening corrected energy (caution - metals only) :          -7144.053653950 eV
